{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17677","headline":"句 · 羊士谔","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风泉留古韵，笙磬想遗音。\n桂朽有遗馥，鸾飞安可待。\n尘沙蔼如雾，长波惊飙度。\n雁起汀洲寒，马嘶高城暮。\n银釭倦秋馆，绮瑟瞻永路。\n重有携手期，清光倚玉树。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"羊士谔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17677.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17677","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}